.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH sqop-armor 1 "February 2025" "sqop 0.38.0" 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
sqop\-armor \- Converts binary OpenPGP data to ASCII
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBsqop armor\fR [\fB\-\-debug\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Converts binary OpenPGP data to ASCII
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-\-debug\fR
Emit verbose output for debugging
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
